---
/**
 * Alumni portal › THE NETWORK — search and the globe on one page (Bryan, 2026-09-15). Everything lives
 * in components/portal/Network.tsx: the question, the bar, the chips, the results and the globe share one
 * state, so a query or a chip narrows the list and the stars together, and a tap on a star is the
